    "title": "What channel are the Giants on tonight? What channel are the Orioles on?",
    "text": "April 10, 2026, 5:15 p.m. ETInterleague action shifts to Charm City tonight as the San Francisco Giants open a three-game weekend series against the Baltimore Orioles. Both teams are hovering around the .500 mark early in the 2026 season and are looking to climb the standings in their respective divisions. Here's how to watch:What MLB games are one Apple TV tonight?Los Angeles Angels at Cincinnati Reds: 6:45 p.m. EasternSan Francisco Giants at Baltimore Orioles: 7:15 p.m. EasternAngels vs Reds pitching matchupJack Kochanowicz (Angels) vs. Chase Burns (Reds)Giants vs Orioles pitching matchupLanden Roupp (Giants) vs. Shane Baz (Orioles)How to watch Friday Night BaseballFans can stream “Friday Night Baseball” through the Apple TV app on Apple devices, smart TVs, gaming consoles and Roku or Amazon Fire TV. The games are also available at tv.apple.com. New subscribers can start a seven-day free trial before the $12.99 monthly fee begins.Apple TV+ baseball schedule 2026Friday, April 17Tampa Bay Rays at Pittsburgh Pirates: 6:45 p.m. EasternDetroit Tigers at Boston Red Sox: 7:15 p.m. EasternFriday, April 24Philadelphia Phillies at Atlanta Braves: 7:15 p.m. EasternChicago Cubs at Los Angeles Dodgers: 10:15 p.m. EasternFriday, May 1Cincinnati Reds at Pittsburgh Pirates: 6:45 p.m. EasternKansas City Royals at Seattle Mariners: 9:45 p.m. EasternFriday, May 8Minnesota Twins at Cleveland Guardians: 7:15 p.m. EasternSt. Louis Cardinals at San Diego Padres: 9:45 p.m. EasternFriday, May 15Toronto Blue Jays at Detroit Tigers: 6:45 p.m. EasternNew York Yankees at New York Mets: 7:15 p.m. EasternFriday, May 22Houston Astros at Chicago Cubs: 2:20 p.m. EasternDetroit Tigers at Baltimore Orioles: 7:15 p.m. EasternFriday, May 29Minnesota Twins at Pittsburgh Pirates: 6:45 p.m. EasternPhiladelphia Phillies at Los Angeles Dodgers: 10:15 p.m. EasternFriday, June 5Cleveland Guardians at Texas Rangers: 8:15 p.m. EasternKansas City Royals at Minnesota Twins: 8:15 p.m. EasternFriday, 